        <h2>New Rental Order Received 📦</h2>

        <p>Hello {{vendorName}},</p>

        <p>You have received a new rental order. Please review the details and confirm it to proceed with delivery.</p>

        <div class="info-box">
            <strong>Order #{{rentalNumber}}</strong>
        </div>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>Customer:</th>
                <td>{{customerName}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Product:</th>
                <td>{{productName}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Rental Period:</th>
                <td>{{startDate}} to {{endDate}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Monthly Rent:</th>
                <td>₹{{monthlyRent}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Security Deposit:</th>
                <td>₹{{securityDeposit}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Total Amount:</th>
                <td>₹{{totalAmount}}</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <h3>Delivery Address:</h3>
        <p>
            {{deliveryAddress.addressLine1}}<br>
            {{#if deliveryAddress.addressLine2}}{{deliveryAddress.addressLine2}}<br>{{/if}}
            {{deliveryAddress.city}}, {{deliveryAddress.state}} - {{deliveryAddress.pincode}}
        </p>

        <center>
            <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" class="button">Confirm This Order</a>
        </center>

        <p>If the order looks good, confirm it from your vendor dashboard as soon as possible so the delivery can be scheduled.</p>

        <p>Thank you for being a RentEase partner!</p>

        <p>Best Regards,<br>The RentEase Team</p>
